        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Blue woolen warp; white woolen weft, woven in satin damask. Pattern shows symmetrical arrangement of undulating lace ribbons and floral sprigs in blue and white; along central axis and outer edges, sprigs and bouquets brocaded with polychrome wools. Flat narrow white selvedges, both complete."@en ;
